{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vh7zoZEupT1794937189.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>甲一籃球聯賽，香港東方以9分，不敵崇德飛鷹。</p><p></p><p>白衫的東方，助攻的連加特，交出12分，他們五人得分雙位數。飛鷹有四人，吳松峻取得14分10籃板9助攻，庫薩斯有最高27分14籃板，他們半場領先8分。</p><p></p><p>東方的徐鑫洋及歐文輝，同得10分。後備蘇柏軒攻入22分，陳兆榮取得16分，包括三球三分。主力楊博文只得2分，東方前三節得分不及對手。</p><p></p><p>飛鷹帶著11分優勢，打最後一節，最後贏84-75，取得今季第四勝，東方則第二次輸球。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T18:38:58.859032+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:17:24.341364+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T18:32:14.163526+00:00","content_hash":"b9645e885547df07428aee999c7df60a6ffa9569edaf5ab5105f9aa85e1e95fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}